    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Training 6 — Pension Enquiry (Main + 3 Sub-workflows)\n\n**Flow:** enquiry in → prepare → **save row in Supabase** (status `new`, gets `id`) → **Sub 1** email member → **Sub 2** notify admin → **Sub 3** update same row to `completed` → reply\n\n**Setup:** import the 3 Subs first, then pick each one in its `Sub` node.\n\n---\n\n### 🧪 Test — POST `/training-pension-enquiry`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"full_name\": \"Aravind Kumar\",\n  \"email\": \"aravindsg072@gmail.com\",\n  \"query_type\": \"transfer\",\n  \"message\": \"I want to transfer my pension\"\n}\n```\n\n**Expect:** `{ \"ok\": true, \"reference\": \"PEN-5\", \"status\": \"completed\" }` + 2 emails",
